{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Power Pro 3-inch outdoor screws felt like a natural next choice because I recently chose the same brand's 4-inch outdoor screws; the shorter length could suit another part of the same work.",
    "The 2-inch stainless steel deck screws matched both my recent 2-inch wood screw purchase and my interest in outdoor fastening. Their length and intended use made them relevant."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Finish nails and brads look related to my framing nails, but their dimensions, intended jobs, and equipment requirements differ. I would not choose them simply because I recently bought nails.",
    "Electrical screws and magnetic hooks do not address the wood fastening and screw-mounted installation needs reflected in my recent choices.",
    "The sealant and epoxy assume sealing or bonding jobs I have not shown a need for. Likewise, buying medicine cups does not mean I need a thousand small exam gloves."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My nail purchases seem to have been treated as interest in any nail, even though framing nails and short finishing brads are not interchangeable for my work.",
    "My purchases seem to have been stretched into a general need for repair supplies and medical supplies, when I choose items for specific tasks."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Fastener length, thickness, intended material, and tool compatibility matter to me. My recent framing nail purchases included specific dimensions and collation types.",
    "My repeated wood screw purchases are a stronger reason to suggest suitable wood screws than to suggest unrelated supplies. Outdoor suitability and useful length variations make the connection stronger.",
    "Pack size and fit can make an otherwise plausible item unsuitable: six sealant cartridges require a substantial sealing need, and small gloves would need to fit me."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "You recognized my interest in wood fasteners, but stretched it into supplies for jobs and equipment I have not indicated I need."
}"}
